    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market, this outstanding split-level luxury residence, set in tranquil surroundings on a private circa 3.37-acre site boasting breathtaking views of stunning Lough Derg & located only 3.5kms from all amenities in the popular lakeside town of Killaloe. Presented to the market in pristine turn-key condition, Crag Point is a superb property with magnificent mature gardens, offering the would-be purchaser the rare opportunity to experience the joys of lakeside living at its best with the added bonus of an impressive private harbour - A rare commodity - Early viewing strongly recommended, especially for the lakeshore enthusiast."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "To include - Reception Conservatory, Lounge, Kitchen/Dining Area, Formal Dining Area, Study, Sun Corridor, 4/5 Bedrooms - 3 En-suite, Dress Room, Sauna, Recreation/Games Room, Utility, Guest Shower Room & Side Entrance Porch."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Reception Conservatory - 9.26m x 4.22m \r\nBright & spacious - filled with natural light. Bath sandstone tiled floor. Sliding door access to composite deck balcony area overlooking Lough Derg.\r\n\r\nOpen-Plan Kitchen/Dining Area, Lounge & Formal Dining Area - \r\n\r\n\r\nFormal Dining Area - 7.11m x 4.07m \r\nFumed oak timber floor. Open fire in marble surround fireplace with cast iron insert & granite hearth. Dual aspect windows to include breathtaking picture-view feature window overlooking Lough Derg. Beamed cathedral ceiling with recessed lighting. Radiator covers. Arched access to lounge area & double French door access to Kitchen/Dining area.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 6.08m x 4.30m \r\nFumed oak timber floor. Fully fitted units to include integrated double electric oven, hob, extractor, dishwasher & fridge. Built-in dresser. Antique-style cast iron open fireplace. Dual aspect picture-view windows overlooking Lough Derg. Beamed cathedral ceiling with recessed lighting & Velux window allowing natural light through. Over-counter tiling & granite work top. Radiator cover.\r\n\r\nUtility - 5.73m x 1.57m \r\nFumed oak timber floor & ceramic tile feature. Fully fitted units to include sink. Over-counter tiling. Fully shelved hot press with immersion located here also. Recessed lighting. Attic access. \r\n\r\nSide Entrance Porch - 1.96m x 1.85m \r\nCeramic tiled floor. Sliding PVC door access.\r\n\r\nLounge - 7.04m x 6.05m \r\nFumed oak timber floor. Open fire in marble surround fireplace with slate hearth & fender. Dual aspect picture-view windows to include French door access to composite deck balcony area boasting breathtaking views of Lough Derg. Coving. Recessed lighting. Radiator covers. Carpeted spiral stairs to lower floor. \r\n\r\nStudy/Bedroom 5 - 6.08m x 2.98m \r\nOak timber floor. Wall-to-wall built-in libruary & desk. Coving. Radiator cover. Currently used as a study/home office. \r\n\r\nEn-Suite - \r\nIncluded Above. Wall & floor tiled. Shower off mains, WC & WHB. \r\n\r\nSun Corridor - \r\n+ 7.93m. x 0.80m. Bright & spacious private area linking the living areas to the private resting spaces. Bath sandstone tiled floor. Wall-to-wall picture view windows to include sliding door access to composite deck/balcony area boasting breathtaking views over Lough Derg. Recessed lighting & overhead Velux window allowing natural light through. Bay window. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 6.07m x 4.87m \r\nCarpeted. Dual aspect windows to include picture-view window overlooking Lough Derg. Wall-to-wall built-in wardrobes. Radiator covers. Coving. Recessed lighting. \r\n\r\nEn-Suite - \r\nIncluded Above. Wall & floor tiled. Shower off mains, WC & WHB. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nGuest Shower Room - 3.78m x 1.50m \r\nWall & floor tiled. Shower off mains, WC & WHB. Built-in mirrored storage cabinet. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.74m x 3.60m \r\nCarpeted. Dual aspect picture-view windows overlooking Lough Derg. 3-door built-in wardrobes. Coving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.62m x 2.99m \r\nCarpeted. Picture-view window overlooking Lough Derg. Coving. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 3.45m x 1.37m \r\nWall & floor tiled. Large shower off mains, WC & WHB. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nLOWER FLOOR - \r\nAccessed via carpeted spiral stairs from Lounge area.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom Suite - 6.81m x 5.94m \r\nFumed oak timber floor. Large picture-view window unit to include double French doors to composite deck area overlooking Lough Derg. Coving. Recessed lighting. Radiator cover.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - \r\nIncluded Above. Wall & floor tiled. Jacuzzi bath, shower off mains, WC & WHB. Large mirror in built-in surround storage units. Recessed lighting. Radiator towel rail. Extractor fan. Access to dress room, sauna & recreation/games room. \r\n\r\nDress Room - 6.82m x 3.86m \r\nFumed oak timber floor. Dual aspect picture-view windows to include French Door access to composite deck area overlooking Lough Derg. Wall-to-wall built-in wardrobes. Timber ceiling with recessed lighting. Open fire in marble surround fireplace with cast iron insert & granite hearth.\r\n\r\nSauna Area - 5.98m x 2.68m \r\nNewly upgraded. Ceramic tiled floor & acoustic timber wall panels. Cedarwood sauna unit with Harvia sauna electric heater. 3-phase power.\r\n\r\nRecreation/Games Room - 6.10m x 4.45m \r\nFumed oak timber floor. Treble aspect picture-view windows to include sliding door access to composite deck area overlooking Lough Derg. Large corner shower unit off mains. Acoustic timber wall panels. Recessed lighting. Plumbed for Hot Tub.\n\r\n\r\nGarage/Storage Shed 1 - 6.66m x 2.84m \r\nDouble hardwood entrance doors.\r\n\r\nGarage/Storage Shed 2 - 6.66m x 3.00m \r\nDouble hardwood entrance doors.\r\n\r\nGarage/Storage Shed 3 - 6.66m x 2.00m \r\nDouble hardwood entrance doors.\r\n\r\nBoat Shed - 7.87m x 6.20m \r\nLarge entrance door. Half walled with corrugated side sheeting\r\n\r\nCottage Studio - 8.40m x 6.60m \r\nFully fitted with separate power supply. Ideal for home office or Gym use.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ideally located at the hub of the mid-west - University of Limerick (29kms - 29 mins), Shannon Airport (60kms - 47 mins), J27-M7 Motorway (11kms - 13 mins) & Red Cow Roundabout, Dublin City (175kms - 2 hours). \r\nClose proximity to the new Killaloe by-pass, all sports facilities, primary & secondary schools to include the renowned Irish Steiner/Waldorf School.\r\nServices - To include - Oil fired central heating. Private well & Bio-cycle treatment unit. 12.5 KVA back-up generator (Oil driven). Car charger. Alarm & CCTV security system. High-speed Wi-Fi. \r\nCut-stone entrance with wrought iron electric gates & pillar lights leading to a meandering kerbed tarmacadam & cobble lock driveway with storm lamp lighting.\r\nPrivate Harbour area with slipway to moor a boat. Boat shed. Cottage Studio & 3 Garages/Store sheds.\r\nNeatly manicured lawned gardens with mature trees, hedges, shrubbery beds & gravelled footpaths.\r\nDirect access to popular footpath/walkway to Killaloe, Two-Mile-Gate Amenity Area, Ogonnelloe & Scarriff. Located within walking distance of the Moylussa hiking summit & University of Limerick Activity Centre."
      },
